<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hover mouse over crafting with 15 rag strips in your inventory and start the macro. It will automatically train your survival skill by crafting and uncrafting rags. Must not use in in windowed mode. Make sure it is active window only. Best to run while you sleep or are afk as you cannot background this task.</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
